              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeosavati mũsumbĩ wa Yuta asyoka e na mũuo nyũmbanĩ yake ku Yelusaleme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeu mwana wa Aanani ũla mwoni aumaala amũthaũe, na amũkũlya mũsumbĩ Yeosavati, Nĩwaĩle kũtethya athũku, na kũmenda ala mamũmenaa Yeova? Nũndũ wa ũndũ ũũ ũthilĩku wĩ ĩũlũ waku kuma kwa Yeova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
